{"title": "-mtime 与 -mmin 语义实测", "lines": [
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "touch -d '49 hours ago' h49.txt"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "find . -name 'h49.txt' -mtime +48"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "无输出：49 小时前的文件不满足 -mtime +48"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "find . -name 'h49.txt' -mmin +2880"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "./h49.txt"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "find . -name 'd50.txt' -mtime +48"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "./d50.txt"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "-mtime +48 实际指 49 个完整天之前；小时级控制用 -mmin"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：Rocky Linux 9.3 容器 (findutils 4.8.0)"}
]}
